   \[
   \text{Fe(OH)}_3(s) + 6\text{CN}^- \rightleftharpoons \text{FeCN}_6^{4-} + 3\text{H}_2\text{O}
   \]
   The equilibrium constant is:
   \[
   K_{eq} = \frac{[\text{FeCN}_6^{4-}]}{[\text{CN}^-]^3}
   \]

