2. Particle size and shape: Smaller-sized GO sheets with a more uniform shape can lead to better mechanical properties compared to larger-sized or irregularly-shaped GO sheets. This is because smaller particles can better distribute the stress and prevent crack propagation.

3. Surface chemistry: The surface chemistry of GO can also influence its mechanical properties. Functionalizing GO with functional groups that can interact with the polymer matrix can improve the interaction between GO and the polymer, leading to better mechanical properties.

