   - \(m = 4 \times 1.6605 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{kg}\) (mass of \(^4\text{He}\)),
   - \(k_B = 1.381 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{J/K}\) (Boltzmann constant),
   - \(T = 290 \, \text{K}\).
   \[
   \lambda = \frac{6.626 \times 10^{-34}}{\sqrt{2\pi \times 4 \times 1.6605 \times 10^{-27} \times 1.381 \times 10^{-23} \times 290}}
   \]
   \[
   \lambda \approx 1.5 \times 10^{-12} \, \text{m}
   \]

