   - \(v_{\text{Earth}} = 9.8 \times 10^{-11} \text{ m/s}\) (reowned recoil velocity of the Earth)

2. **Solve for \(v_{\text{Earth}}\)**:
   \[
   v_{\text{Earth}} = \frac{m_{\text{cannonball}} v_{\text{cannonball}}}{m_{\text{Earth}}} = \frac{(1 \text{ kg})(90.0 \text{ m/s})}{5.97 \times 10^{24} \text{ kg}}
   \]
   \[
   v_{\text{Earth}} = \frac{90.0}{5.97 \times 10^{24}} \text{ m/s} = 1.51 \times 10^{-22} \text{ m/s}
   \]

