     \[
     v = \frac{Re \cdot \nu}{L} = \frac{40,000 \cdot 0.000726}{0.2} = 15.62 \, \text{m/s}
     \]  
     (Assuming \( \nu = 0.000726 \, \text{m}^2/\text{s} \) for air at 1 atm and 50°C.  
