\[
a = \frac{F}{m} = \frac{8.0 \times 10^{-17} \, \text{N}}{1.67 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{kg}} = 4.81 \times 10^{10} \, \text{m/s}^2.
\]  
The magnitude of the acceleration is \(\boxed{4.81 \times 10^{10} \, \text{m/s}^2}\).

