\nabla \times \mathbf{V} = \boxed{\mathbf{0} + 0\mathbf{j} - \frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_y}{\partial y} \mathbf{k}} = -\frac{\partial \mathbf{V}_y}{\partial y} \mathbf{k}.
